{"author":{"id":"973fc03426eba9a243913e0f6e6823e102397744f60a9ab11c882af948c310c4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1778099942,"nonce":"hYYv4D2bYz6lmkPrOJ1tODcoy3M=","title":"Skip auto-close for issues with `coordination` label","message":"Implements the feature requested in dotfiles `49e81d9` (cross-repo): in `mandible auth merge`'s post-merge auto-close step, check the `coordination` label on each `Bug:`-trailer-referenced issue and skip closure if present.\n\nThis decouples **phase umbrellas** (label `umbrella`, phase-tied, OK to close on merge) from **coordination issues** (label `coordination`, project-spanning, never auto-close). The accident that closed rlrmp `b557d4e` motivated the distinction.\n\nSee dotfiles `49e81d9` for the full design discussion. This issue tracks the actual implementation in the mandible repo.","files":null}]}